# PowerShell scripts MUST stay CRLF. PowerShell 5.1's parser choked on
# the LF-only verify-bundle.ps1 with cryptic "The string is missing the
# terminator" errors. UTF-8 BOM is preserved as file content (Git treats
# it as bytes). See BundleVerifierScriptRoundTripTests for the regression
# guard that catches a future re-normalisation.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
